{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會討論兩電周年電費檢討／亞洲數學聯盟成立典禮\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261124.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會環境事務委員會今日(11月24日)開會討論兩電周年電費檢討。另外，中大舉行亞洲數學聯盟成立典禮，數學家丘成桐教授將出席。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:03:14.287296+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:24:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:57:05.922802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T23:56:38.890867+00:00","content_hash":"a192c13d3e08f656f24b7e1356ae5394b0ed9fbfce394eba9a3c5cd839eb2e02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}